<title>ITALY: SCI sells stake in Alsace daily - Montedison.</title>
<headline>SCI sells stake in Alsace daily - Montedison.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Societe Centrale d'Investissements (SCI), jointly controlled by Italian agrichemical group Montedison  MNT MI and France's group Vernes, has sold its stake in a Strasbourg daily newspaper.</p>
<p>Montedison said in a statement that SCI had sold the stake in the Dernieres Nouvelles d'Alsace paper for 250 million French francs or about 75 billion lire to a regional French press group.</p>
<p>(( --Milan bureau ))</p>
</text>
